00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:54.260
More efficiency equals less energy needed to perform the same amount of work.

00:00:54.260 --> 00:01:00.360
Less energy needed equals fewer batteries, less cost, and less mass, and faster charging.

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:05.260
